Ladybird loads a restored background tab only when it’s selected, as
Firefox does with browser.sessionstore.restore_on_demand (true by
default). Chromium’s BackgroundTabLoadingPolicy instead loads such tabs
gradually, between kMinSimultaneousTabLoads and kMaxSimultaneousTabLoads
at a time, with kMaxTabsToLoad and kMaxTimeSinceLastUseToLoad cutoffs.
